SUMMARY:Mary Poppins the Musical - Dutch Apple Dinner Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Everyone’s favorite nanny is back! Adventure abounds as you get whisked away to meet dancing chimney sweeps and an array of colorful characters in this beloved musical. Hear classics like Supercalifragilisticexpialidocious\, A Spoonful of Sugar\, and Chim Chim Cher-ee. \nApproximate Run Time: 2 Hours and 45 Minutes\n\n\n  \n\nCome Explore Our Lancaster Theaters and the Arts\n\n\nLive Theater\nLive Entertainment\nLive Music\n\n\n\nDinner Theaters\nMurder Mysteries\nThings To Do\n\n\n\nArtisan Collectives\nArt Galleries\nEvents Calendar
