SUMMARY:Sports Variety Camp at Linden Hall
DESCRIPTION:Beginning in 2026\, Linden Hall will offer two co-ed Sports Camps – Sports Variety Camp and Soccer Camp!\nHave you ever wanted to try a new sport but weren’t sure where to start? \nDo you like variety and don’t want to be limited to just one activity? \nOur Sports Variety Camp offers the chance for campers to get a “taste” of a different sport each day. \nEach three-hour activity session features a sport offered at Linden Hall led by experienced coaches. \nThe sports include archery\, basketball\, volleyball\, tennis\, and horseback riding. \nNew and experienced athletes can test out their skills and try new techniques. Come join the fun! \nTake a look at many more Summer Camps offered throughout Lancaster County this summer!\n\nAdditional Fun Things for Kids To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nSummer Camps\nPetting Zoo\nRailroad Attractions\n\n\n\nFun on the Farm\nAmusement Parks\nMini Golf\n\n\n\nArcades & Video Games\nZip-Lines\nEvents Calendar
